      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/7/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 119(2) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “to a fine not exceeding two thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months and, in the case of a second or subsequent conviction, to a fine not exceeding four thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding twelve months” the words “to a fine of not less than one thousand ringgit and not more than two thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both and, in the case of a second or subsequent conviction, to a fine of not less than two thousand ringgit and not more than ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years”. Amendment of section 119b"
      }
    },
