        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), any outstanding matter or case in relation to a particular motor vehicle of a person shall not affect any other motor vehicle registered under his name.”. New section 119c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/7/eng@/~cl_36",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "36",
